Regarding our 2018 profitability, I'll begin in the Commercial/Industrial segment, where we lowered operating income guidance by $3 million, mainly due to potential risks associate associated with tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/curtiss-wright-corp-cw-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2018 Q3","e":"cw","d":"2018-10-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Nathan Jones","x":"I think we've heard about some of those kinds of products potentially having some limited availability out there at the moment, has that pushed prices up you've not been able to pass it through yet?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/curtiss-wright-corp-cw-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2018 Q3","e":"cw","d":"2018-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Glenn E. Tynan","x":"Those impacts were partially offset by savings generated from our prior year -- our prior year restructuring initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/curtiss-wright-corp-cw-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2018 Q3","e":"cw","d":"2018-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"David C. Adams","x":"Based on the strong operational performance thus far in 2018 and our outlook for continued momentum through the end of the year, we increased our full-year outlook for operating margin, diluted EPS and free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/curtiss-wright-corp-cw-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2018 Q3","e":"cw","d":"2018-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Glenn E. Tynan","x":"Well, last quarter, we increased, because year to date, we had a very strong first half, there a couple of one timers -- not one-timer, but timing issues with the second half of the year and some things that let us to increase our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/curtiss-wright-corp-cw-q3-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2018 Q4","e":"cw","d":"2019-02-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Glenn Tynan","x":"Partially offsetting that improvement is $4 million per tariffs and a $3 million increase in R&D. Excluding these two items, segment operating margin guidance would have reflected a 100 basis point to 110 basis point increase compared to 2018 results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/curtiss-wright-corp-cw-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2018 Q4","e":"cw","d":"2019-02-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Adam Farley","x":"And then just price cost in tariffs, you guys have managed pretty well there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/curtiss-wright-corp-cw-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2018 Q4","e":"cw","d":"2019-02-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Glenn Tynan","x":"I mean, we continue to monitor that whole global tariff situation and have been addressing any cost issues with our supply chain, including alternative sourcing or raising our prices, if necessary.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/curtiss-wright-corp-cw-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2018 Q4","e":"cw","d":"2019-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Glenn Tynan","x":"Higher operating income will be driven by higher sales volume and the benefit of ongoing margin improvement initiatives, including restructuring actions taken in the fourth quarter of 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/curtiss-wright-corp-cw-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2018 Q4","e":"cw","d":"2019-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dave Adams","x":"This new location will also provide future cost saving opportunities to our customers based on its proximity to deepwater ports in South Carolina.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/curtiss-wright-corp-cw-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2019 Q1","e":"cw","d":"2019-05-09","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Glenn Tynan","x":"Our results in this segment also include savings generated from our ongoing margin improvement initiatives, partially offset by the net impact from tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/curtiss-wright-cw-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2019 Q1","e":"cw","d":"2019-05-09","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Glenn Tynan","x":"And as a reminder our guidance for this segment includes $4 million net impact from tariffs and a $3 million year-over-year increase in R&D. In the defense segment, based on TCG's expected $10 million increase to our aerospace defense market guidance, we now expect this segment sales to be up 4%…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/curtiss-wright-cw-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2019 Q1","e":"cw","d":"2019-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Glenn Tynan","x":"Yeah, I would just say as an example, restructuring, you heard us talk about over the last couple of years it's still a big part of our ongoing margin improvement program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/curtiss-wright-cw-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2019 Q1","e":"cw","d":"2019-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dave Adams","x":"So we have margin improvement activity around that, all the categories, consolidations, restructuring, supply chain, lean, focus on our bottom 10 performing businesses, blah, blah, blah.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/curtiss-wright-cw-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2019 Q1","e":"cw","d":"2019-05-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dave Adams","x":"We raised our guidance for sales, adjusted operating income, margin and diluted earnings per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/curtiss-wright-cw-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2019 Q1","e":"cw","d":"2019-05-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dave Adams","x":"What we raised our guidance for is what's going to happen in the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/curtiss-wright-cw-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2019 Q2","e":"cw","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Glenn Tynan","x":"Mainly offsetting that improvement was $1 million for tariffs and the $2 million increase in R&D. In the defense segment, adjusted operating income and margin reflects unfavorable mix for our defense electronics products, $2 million in higher R&D investments and a difficult comp to the prior year…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/curtiss-wright-cw-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2019 Q2","e":"cw","d":"2019-08-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Glenn Tynan","x":"Commercial industrial segment guidance includes a $4 million net impact from tariffs and a $3 million year-over-year increase in R&D. Defense segment guidance includes a $5 million year-over-year increase in R&D. Excluding this R&D investment, defense segment operating margin guidance would have…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/curtiss-wright-cw-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2019 Q2","e":"cw","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Dave Adams","x":"As noted on our February conference call, we were able to mitigate approximately 50% of the expected tariff impact primarily through price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/curtiss-wright-cw-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CW 2019 Q2","e":"cw","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dave Adams","x":"And then you look at acquiring companies like DRG and TCG and TTC and then others, getting up to little bit larger acquisitions to start filling some of that, and